# The Social Engineering window (see socialwin.c): the three allocation bars along the foot of the main screen (economy, psych and
# labs, in tenths of the energy), each with a - and a + button at its ends and a lock at its foot. The faction starts at economy
# 50%, psych 0% and labs 50%. A - on economy gives a tenth to the next bar round (psych); the loss a skewed allocation brings
# shows in the energy box (labs over economy first, then economy over labs, then with labs at none); a lock keeps a bar from giving or
# taking. The bars' buttons are at y 719 (the locks at y 745): economy - 24 and + 244, psych - 271 and + 496, labs - 522 and + 748;
# the locks at x 22, 270 and 522.
# Leave time after each step; the snaps take 2 s each.
25 load
42 state ifc 0x8a6c9c 8
42 state work 0x8a6f64 0x74
42 state alloc 0x8a8e94 0x3c
42 state rects 0x8c5240 0x320
42 state lock0 0x8a79f0 4
42 state lock1 0x8a841c 4
42 state lock2 0x8a8e48 4
42 state energy_a 0x749ae4 4
42 state energy_b 0x749c0c 4
42 state parse 0x9bbfec 8
42 state bufword 0x7aec74 4
42 state curiface 0x7ae7f8 4
44 click 362 734
48 open social_open
56 click 475 736
60 snap open
62 click 24 719
65 snap econ-minus
67 click 24 719
69 click 24 719
